        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw9om5vj-qfbonkk",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      },
      "text": "Over 16 days, you will explore Peru’s main cultural and natural regions, then spend a few days relaxing by the Pacific. The itinerary takes you through Lima, Cusco, Machu Picchu, the Sacred Valley, Puno, Lake Titicaca, Colca Canyon and Arequipa, with very little backtracking. After the sightseeing portion, you will fly to Tumbes to relax on the coast."
